      "observation_and_limit": "Old patch replaces the serde_yaml dependency alias with published yaml_serde 0.10.7/libyaml-rs 0.3.0 and removes the corresponding unmaintained-package policy exceptions. Selected upstream retains serde_yaml 0.9.34+deprecated and unsafe-libyaml 0.2.11, including both policy entries. This is a package migration, not a dependency-source security backport. Select current stable replacements and check semantics/license/policy during step 7; do not copy old generated lock data or remove exceptions before migration actually eliminates the package."
